      "title": "Accusative pronouns",
      "sortorder": 2,
      "explanation": "Compare forms of the object. In particular: ich→mich, du→dich, er→ihn, wir→uns and ihr→euch.",
      "rule": "wen? (whom?) / was? (what?)",
      "entries": [
        {
          "header": "sehen — changing the object",
          "kind": "comparison",
          "explanation": "The verb remains the same while the accusative pronoun changes to match the person or thing seen.",
